      'Session ${metadata.id} is live (pid ${row.pid ?? 'unknown'}, '
      'heartbeat ${row.touchedAt}) — delete refused. Stop the owning '
      'process first; the refusal is itself the data-loss guard.',
      code: SessionErrorCode.liveSession,
